# Tabs - firefox (actions/firefox/firefox_tabs.kbd)
**tabs + l**        -- Tabs Next
**tabs + h**        -- Tabs Prev
**tabs + t**        -- Tabs New
**tabs + w**        -- Tabs Close
**tabs + lsft + t** -- Tabs Undo Close
**tabs + 1**        -- Tabs Goto 1
**tabs + 2**        -- Tabs Goto 2
**tabs + 3**        -- Tabs Goto 3
**tabs + 4**        -- Tabs Goto 4
**tabs + 5**        -- Tabs Goto 5
**tabs + 6**        -- Tabs Goto 6
**tabs + 7**        -- Tabs Goto 7
**tabs + 8**        -- Tabs Goto 8
**tabs + 9**        -- Tabs Goto 9
**tabs + toggle**   -- Tabs Toggle
**tabs + move + h** -- Tabs Move Left
**tabs + move + l** -- Tabs Move Right
**tabs + move + j** -- Tabs Move First
**tabs + move + k** -- Tabs Move Last
